    "body": "Update on 2026-11-27: a second red run arrived on the tip of that run.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/46033295171 (head `bc8ac92f136febef68d42bb8f413b463ebbae3d9`, merge of #4374)\n\nFailing steps:\n\n```\n     FAIL in 1s exit 1\n   FAIL     1s  clippy -D warnings  exit 1\n```\n\nNo log output in the run. A 1-second clippy failure is the shape of a runner/toolchain fault, not a real lint. This run carries a FAIL row, so it is a red main, not a runner stop.\n\nA third run hit the 75-minute step timeout with no FAIL row (run 46029938781, head `159ee374855281904e1fb3ea7069a4eee61568f8`): a runner stop. It is logged on #3303 and re-run once. It opens no change to this issue.\n",
